    "palette": "iPhone generates all four opaque appearance/contrast variants; Watch generates dark/default and dark/high-contrast variants from the same canonical palette.",
    "implemented": "Shared scalable reading, support, metadata, section, observation and action roles; 24-point controls and cards, 28-point hero/camera, 18-point icon tiles; 64/56-point primary/secondary minimum heights. Home uses the deck hero and adaptive paired shortcuts. SF Symbols preserve native semantics.",
    "preservedTargets": "System Dynamic Type and native tab/navigation affordances remain authoritative. Mockup status and measurements are not live sensing evidence.",
